{"slug": "volume5-part1/280", "title": "30.", "volume": "volume5-part1", "sourceUrl": "https://budget.up.nic.in/Fin_H_Book/volume5/part1/280.html", "html": "<font color=\"#000080\" size=\"5\"><p align=\"CENTER\">FORM no. 30</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">[See Chapter XIII, paragraph 287]</p>\n<p align=\"CENTER\">Monthly statement of demands, realizations and arrears of rents\tMonth–––––, 19 .</p></font>\n<table border=\"\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"640\">\n<tr><td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"8%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Serial number</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"8%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Name of building</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"8%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Name and designation of the occupant</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"6%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Emoluments of the occupant.</p></font></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"104\" valign=\"MIDDLE\" width=\"27%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Monthly rate of rent</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"4%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Arrears from last month.</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"6%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Assessment for the month.</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"4%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Total amount to be realized.</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"4%\">\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Realized during the month</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"104\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"9%\">\n<font color=\"#800